  "ruleText": "Env-A 2909.01 Annual Compliance Certification Required. The AAR for each affected source shall submit an annual compliance certification to the department no later than January 30 of each year.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
